  "additional_notes": "The Barbarians list represents a whole range of wild and savage warbands from hulking Neanderthal warriors of the Ice Age astride bellowing mammoths, hairy Norse raiders accompanied by fearless berserkers, and the proud Fianna of Celtic legend with their chariot-riding heroes. Our list is highly adaptable and can be used to create warbands from a wide variety of historical cultures as well as the mythic past. It is also an ideal way of building a force inspired by the pages of classic Sword & Sorcery fiction and - of course - the movies and model ranges inspired by them.",
